      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be awesome to have, it solves many issues and limitations of the base Unity NavMesh system. \n\nThe biggest thing I'm currently missing are the volumes, which allow you to set multiple NavMesh areas on the same object. This is essential for terrains. Also really nice for blocking off nav mesh islands inside of other objects and undesirable locations. (no more invisible editor only mesh spam every 0.5 meters :D)\n\nMoreover, Movable NavMesh surfaces and improved NavMeshLinks could greatly enhance NPC movement capabilities and behavior possibilities.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-07-01T16:07:54.771Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This repo is distributed by Unity to enable powerful nav mesh capabilities for AI and NPC's: https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/NavMeshComponents \nIn addition to the already-whitelisted NavMesh components, it would be cool to be able to use these in VRChat worlds.",
